# DK Holidays — Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and insert your real API keys if available.
# The application includes automatic, resilient fallbacks (Open-Meteo for weather,
# and high-fidelity contextual knowledge for DK AI) so it runs 100% out of the box!

# OpenWeather API Key (https://openweathermap.org/api)
VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweather_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key (https://ai.google.dev/)
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
